{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11111300","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11111300","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1111130001:1":{"text":"Magister, Chippy found a treasure map!","source_cn":"主人，满满发现了一张藏宝图！！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2563F41860903973","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, Chippy found a treasure map!","female":"Magister, Chippy found a treasure map!","variant_male_record_index":"121920","variant_female_record_index":"121921","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::1":{"text":"Treasure Map","source_cn":"一张藏宝图","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE32D4C0A30C869F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111130002:2":{"text":"A treasure map? Can't say I've laid eyes on a Mauler treasure map before.","source_cn":"藏宝图？蛮血的藏宝图我倒是第一次见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FA6CFF4B20F630F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111130003:0":{"text":"Three spots are marked. Does this point to treasure in the Crimson Highlands?","source_cn":"标记了三处地点。这是深红高原宝藏的分布图？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15841C9FBF07A6F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111130004:1":{"text":"Information on bounties and treasure is more often than not full of holes.","source_cn":"悬赏、寻宝，拿到的情报常常不准。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22BE7E1B4819B3E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111130005:1":{"text":"From my experience, that mark in the middle stands apart from the rest. Might be where them Quicksand Claws reckon the real treasure's hidin'. The other two spots seem dubious.","source_cn":"从我的经验看，中间那个显眼的标记与众不同，也许流沙之爪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CA9C9653C6B812F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111130006:1":{"text":"If it truly is a treasure map, no wonder they're guardin' it so fiercely.","source_cn":"如果是藏宝图，那的确是非常重要的情报，不能随便被人得知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06A1BF44163A2ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111130007:1":{"text":"So in order to dig the treasure up, they robbed a cache of tools from everyone?","source_cn":"为了挖掘宝藏，就到处劫人，抢夺挖掘工具？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FDA067EE90ECED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111130008:1":{"text":"Pathetic.","source_cn":"可悲，无聊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE8E23A70F4376A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status"